{"id":"ddc106b348c1676b","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-filtered-set.md","title":"Filtered Set","display":"df-filtered-set — Filtered Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-filtered-set","aliases":["58-df-filtered-set"],"display":"df-filtered-set — Filtered Set","depends_on":["[[../batch15/58-df-filter.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-filtered-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-filtered-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-filtered-set — Filtered Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1331244a5201bb99\" href=\"?note=1331244a5201bb99\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-filter.md\">../batch15/58-df-filter.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in V\">\\(X\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Filter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Filter}_S\\)</span>（偏序滤子谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1331244a5201bb99\" href=\"?note=1331244a5201bb99\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-filter.md\">../batch15/58-df-filter.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FilteredSet}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{FilteredSet}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>（此处定义的“带 proper filter 的集合”谓词）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}filtered\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{FilteredSet}_S(X,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S\\bigl(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal P(X),\\{\\langle A,B\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P(X)\\times\\mathcal P(X):A\\subseteq B\\}\\bigr)\\land\\varnothing\\notin\\mathcal F\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}filtered\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{FilteredSet}_S(X,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S\\bigl(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal P(X),\\{\\langle A,B\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P(X)\\times\\mathcal P(X):A\\subseteq B\\}\\bigr)\\land\\varnothing\\notin\\mathcal F\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>这是集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 连同其幂集上的 proper filter；幂集包含序已在断言中展开为集合关系，排除空集把上游允许的 improper order filter 排除掉。</li>\n<li>范畴论中的 filtered category 或序理论中的 directed preorder 是另一概念，不由本谓词表示。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch15/58-df-filter.md","status":"resolved","id":"1331244a5201bb99","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-filter.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-filter.md","status":"resolved","id":"1331244a5201bb99","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Filter}_S$（偏序滤子谓词，见 [[../batch15/58-df-filter.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Filter}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FilteredSet}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}filtered\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{FilteredSet}_S(X,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S\\bigl(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal P(X),\\{\\langle A,B\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P(X)\\times\\mathcal P(X):A\\subseteq B\\}\\bigr)\\land\\varnothing\\notin\\mathcal F","display":true},{"tex":"X","display":false}],"bytes":1119,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-523","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-filtered-set.md|58-df-filtered-set]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["1331244a5201bb99"]}